<p>
Each <code>config/lore/&lt;code&gt;.json</code> file is just a title lang-key reference and an
ordered array of "piece" lang-key references -- the real prose lives in the lang file itself, not
inline in these files, resolved the same way every other display string is (including
mod-domain-prefixed keys like <code>betterruins:lore-brickworkerslament-title</code>). The game's
own <code>___NEWPAGE___</code> marker inside a piece's text splits it into multiple book pages.
</p>
